    "A question receives at least one domain, one topic or franchise, and one knowledge_skill.",
    "A tag whose only support is the keyed answer or explanation is editorial_relevance only unless the stem/media independently establishes it.",
    "Country uses ISO seed IDs; fictional locations use place:* and never country:*.",
    "Franchise and medium are independent: do not infer film from a book-only question.",
    "Do not create pack-name, difficulty-band, answer-text, or one-off spelling tags. Propose a concept only after reuse across questions or clear future editorial value."
  ]
}
